{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53394","headline":"奉赠叶□郎新湖诗 · 余鼎","name":"奉赠叶□郎新湖诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赏眺新湖趣，澄漪写物华。\n采苹经绿溆，垂钓倚枯槎。\n水动鱼惊鸟，风摇蝶□花。\n宛然登兴处，宁羡武陵家。\n（光绪《上虞县志》卷三七《金石》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"余鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}